    {
      "id": "c25-l3",
      "title": "Freeing a Tree",
      "xp": 15,
      "intro": [
        "Every node came from malloc, so every node has to go back with free. But careful: after free(t), you can't read t->left anymore.",
        "So free the children first and the node last. This is called post-order: left, right, then the node itself.",
        "Counting the nodes and adding up the keys follow the same pattern: do it for the left subtree, do it for the right subtree, and combine the results with the node."
      ],
      "example": {
        "code": [
          "#include <stdio.h>",
          "#include <stdlib.h>",
          "",
          "typedef struct node {",
          "    int key;",
          "    struct node *left, *right;",
          "} Node;",
          "",
          "Node *insert(Node *t, int key) {",
          "    if (t == NULL) {",
          "        t = malloc(sizeof(Node));",
          "        t->key = key;",
          "        t->left = t->right = NULL;",
          "    } else if (key < t->key)",
          "        t->left = insert(t->left, key);",
          "    else",
          "        t->right = insert(t->right, key);",
          "    return t;",
          "}",
          "",
          "int count(Node *t) {",
          "    if (t == NULL) return 0;",
          "    return count(t->left) + 1 + count(t->right);",
          "}",
          "",
          "void destroy(Node *t) {",
          "    if (t == NULL) return;",
          "    destroy(t->left);",
          "    destroy(t->right);",
          "    printf(\"free %d\\n\", t->key);",
          "    free(t);",
          "}",
          "",
          "int main() {",
          "    Node *root = NULL;",
          "    root = insert(root, 2);",
          "    root = insert(root, 1);",
          "    root = insert(root, 3);",
          "    printf(\"%d nodes\\n\", count(root));",
          "    destroy(root);",
          "    root = NULL;",
          "    return 0;",
          "}"
        ],
        "output": []
      },
      "exercises": [
        {
          "id": "c25-l3-e1",
